# Fitmode Support

Thanks for using Fitmode!  
If you need any help, have questions, or want to report an issue, you can reach us through the options below.

## 📬 Contact
- Email: fitmodeapp@gmail.com  
- GitHub Issues: https://github.com/mertoo/fitmode/issues

## 🛠 Report a Bug
If you encounter a problem in the app:
1. Go to the GitHub Issues page.
2. Tap **New Issue**.
3. Describe the problem and the steps to reproduce it.

## 💡 Feature Requests
Have an idea that would make Fitmode better?  
Feel free to open a Feature Request issue on GitHub.

---

We do our best to respond as soon as possible. Thank you for supporting Fitmode!
